OL,3,ARussell Brand to be sentenced for rape
OL,4,Aand sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand will be sentenced today
OL,7,Ffor rape and three counts of sexual
OL,8,Fassault
OL,10,FBrand, 51, was found guilty at
OL,11,FSouthwark Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,12,Fafter a trial that began in October -
OL,13,Fyou'll be able to watch the sentencing
OL,14,Fitself live on this page later
OL,16,FFollowing the verdicts, judge Mr
OL,17,FJustice Bennathan told Brand to expect
OL,18,F"a significant custodial term" - he was
OL,19,Fremanded in custody, meaning he has
OL,20,Fspent the past four nights in prison
OL,21,Fbefore sentencing
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
