OL,3,AWoman says Al Fayed's brother drugged
OL,4,Aand sexually abused her at Highland
OL,5,Aestate
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman has told BBC Scotland how she
OL,8,Fwas trafficked to the Highlands,
OL,9,Fdrugged, sexually assaulted and held
OL,10,Fprisoner by Salah Fayed, the brother of
OL,11,Fformer Harrods owner Mohamed Al Fayed.
OL,13,FJill, whose name has been changed for
OL,14,Flegal reasons, said she was a young
OL,15,FHarrods employee when she was recruited
OL,16,Fto what she believed was an executive
OL,17,Ftraining scheme in the 1990s.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
