OL,3,AThick fog disrupts morning travel as
OL,4,Ayellow weather warnings in effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FYellow weather warnings for dense fog
OL,7,Fremain in effect across parts of the UK
OL,8,Fas low visibility disrupts travel.
OL,10,FA Met Office warning is in place across
OL,11,Fmuch of England and eastern Wales and
OL,12,Fruns until 11:00 GMT on Monday. An
OL,13,Fadditional fog warning has been issued
OL,14,Ffor Northern Ireland running until
OL,15,F10:00 GMT.
OL,17,FThe larger warning covers an area of
OL,18,FEngland and Wales stretching from
OL,19,FCanterbury to Cardiff, Hull to St Asaph
OL,20,Fand Southampton to York, and includes
OL,21,FLondon, Birmingham and parts of Greater
OL,22,FManchester.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
